---
description: Keep AGENTS.md short, structured and current
globs: AGENTS.md,**/AGENTS.md
alwaysApply: false
---
- Keep AGENTS.md under ~150 lines. Link out for detail instead of pasting it in.
- Use these sections in order: Project, Commands (build/test/lint), Conventions, Boundaries (never do), Done means.
- Write commands exactly as they run, in code blocks. Do not use placeholders an agent cannot resolve.
- When a command or convention changes, update AGENTS.md in the same change.
